## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.12+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
- [just](https://just.systems/)
{% if execution_model != "cli" -%}
- [Docker](https://www.docker.com/) (for dependencies)
{% endif -%}
{% if execution_model == "web" -%}
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20+ and [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/) (for frontend)
{% endif %}
### Installation

```sh
uv sync --dev
cp .env.example .env
```
{% if include_database and database_type == "postgres" %}
### Database

```sh
# Start Postgres
docker compose up -d

# Run migrations
uv run alembic upgrade head
```
{% endif %}
### Running
{% if execution_model == "cli" %}
```sh
{{ project_name }} ask "Hello, agent!"
```
{% elif execution_model == "web" %}
```sh
# Start both backend and frontend dev servers
just dev

# Or start separately
just dev-be   # Backend only
just dev-fe   # Frontend only
```
{% else %}
```sh
uv run uvicorn {{ package_name }}.app:app --reload
```
{% endif %}

## Development

```sh
# Check formatting and linting
just fmt
just lint

# Fix formatting and linting
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Run type checker
just typecheck
```

## Testing

```sh
# Run unit tests
just test-unit

# Run all tests
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate
```
{% if execution_model != "cli" %}
